---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Sapiogen AI is an AI-first software engineering studio based in Ahmedabad. Meet the team, the founder, and the studio."
>

  <!-- Page lede -->
  <section class="page-lede">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="sec-index">About the studio</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">
        A small, senior studio<br/>built for AI-first work<span class="dot">.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lede">
        We are an AI-first software engineering studio in Ahmedabad. We hire
        senior, staff lean, and ship together — because that is the shape of
        a team that can take a problem from brief to production without a
        handoff dropping the thread.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why we exist -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container col-split">
      <div class="col-marker"><p class="sec-index">01 — Why we exist</p></div>
      <div>
        <h2>The team we wished existed.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          Sapiogen AI was founded because the kind of team that treats
          AI as a first-class engineering material — not an afterthought —
          was still rare. Teams were either research-strong but
          operationally weak, or operationally strong and still working
          around AI rather than with it.
        </p>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
          We built the studio to close that gap. Engineers who ship
          production AI, pair with senior design and strategy, and remain
          personally accountable for the systems they put into the world.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founder -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container col-split">
      <div class="col-marker"><p class="sec-index">02 — Leadership</p></div>
      <div class="founder">
        <h2>Founder &amp; CEO</h2>
        <div class="founder-card">
          <div class="founder-name">
            <h3>Rahil D. Jain</h3>
            <p class="muted">Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer</p>
          </div>
          <p class="founder-bio">
            Rahil leads engineering direction and client partnerships at
            Sapiogen AI. He founded the studio to answer a specific
            question: what does a software team look like when it is
            engineered around the materials AI gives us, instead of around
            the materials it does not?
          </p>
          <p class="founder-bio" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            Under his lead the studio ships AI-first products end to end
            — from framing the right problem, to designing the system, to
            standing with it in production until the customer&rsquo;s own
            team is operating it confidently.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rahil-d-jain-90536a169"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="link-rule founder-link"
          >
            Rahil on LinkedIn
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Operating principles - DISTINCT from careers page -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container col-split">
      <div class="col-marker"><p class="sec-index">03 — Operating principles</p></div>
      <div>
        <h2>How the studio operates.</h2>
        <div class="principle-grid">
          <article>
            <h3>Fewer people, deeper ownership</h3>
            <p class="muted">We staff lean teams on each engagement, because a small group of senior people with full context beats a large group with partial context, every time.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Decisions written down</h3>
            <p class="muted">Architecture, trade-offs, and the reasoning behind both are documented so the client can argue with them — before the system is built, not after.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Production is the deliverable</h3>
            <p class="muted">Shipped and operating in your production environment is the only state we count as finished. Prototypes are a step, not an output.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h3>Hand over cleanly</h3>
            <p class="muted">Every engagement ends with your team able to own what we built — runbooks, evaluations, and the knowledge to extend the system without us.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Studio & location -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container col-split">
      <div class="col-marker"><p class="sec-index">04 — Studio</p></div>
      <div>
        <h2>Based in Ahmedabad.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
          The studio sits in the heart of Navrangpura, Ahmedabad. We work
          on-site as a team and partner with clients around the world across
          time zones.
        </p>
        <address class="studio-address muted">
          Yamuna Complex, Ganga Jammuna Complex, 5,<br />
          Chimanlal Girdharlal Road, opp. Pushya Hospital,<br />
          near Festo, Shrimali Society, Navrangpura,<br />
          Ahmedabad, Gujarat 380009, India
        </address>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABanner
    eyebrow="05 — Build with us"
    title="Have an AI-first problem?<br/>Let&rsquo;s engineer it."
    primaryHref="/contact"
    primaryLabel="Start a conversation"
    secondaryHref="/careers"
    secondaryLabel="Join the team"
  />

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .principle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem 3rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .principle-grid h3 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .principle-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  }

  .founder-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .founder-name h3 { font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .founder-bio { line-height: 1.65; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 56ch; }
  .founder-link { margin-top: 1.5rem; display: inline-block; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .founder-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
  }

  .studio-address {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
</style>
